Your first shift, guided.

New players get a short walkthrough, and goals above the machines now pay a cash bonus as the shop grows - seventeen of them, from your first shipment to your thousandth.

Sound and vibration: every hit, shipment and level-up now clicks, chimes and buzzes. Both can be turned off under Upgrades.

Optional extras, at the bottom of Upgrades: double pay for good, a Night Crew that works harder while you are away, and a one-off Big Contract.
